cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Padiush Companion in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "Padiush Companion"
abstract: >-
  The mobile field-capture application for the Padiush platform. It records
  interviews entirely offline — answers, audio, photographs and location — in
  an encrypted on-device store, and synchronises them when connectivity allows.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Menéndez"
    given-names: "Mercedes"
    country: SV
  - family-names: "Arévalo"
    given-names: "Rodrigo"
    country: SV
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/padiush/companion"
keywords:
  - ethnobotany
  - ethnobiology
  - offline data capture
  - mobile field research
  - traditional knowledge

# When the methods paper is published, add a preferred-citation block here so
# that citing the software resolves to the paper.
